From: AlexProgrammerDE <40795980+AlexProgrammerDE@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 16:55:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(appearance): manage Character Creator accounts and
 wardrobes

Keep character slots, persona recipe assembly, owned catalogs, purchases and emote account selection above the shared native rendering runtime. Preserve signed appearance selection, classic skin changes and account-specific asset lifetimes.

Refresh common actor inputs and native properties for attached player
particles at each attachment sample, even without another body render.
Keep the sampled locator pose and unrelated graph inputs. Reject a
changed native actor lifetime before reading its metadata, while retaining
the existing registry-only path after actor removal with the same owner.
